id: pm-07m41m
title: Packed telemetry acceptance must await completion across delivery batches
description: "PR 1265 CI run 35278617240 failed installed Node 24 acceptance because the collector asserted command_finish in the first HTTP request. A detached worker may legitimately send command_start before the command finishes. Collect bounded delivery batches until completion arrives, retaining timeout and physical queue assertions, with a real split-request regression."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-17T22:03:34.213Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-17T22:29:35.945Z"
closed_at: "2026-09-17T22:19:52.248Z"
completed_at: "2026-09-17T22:19:52.248Z"
author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: A real collector accepts command_start and command_finish in separate requests within one bounded deadline; missing completion still fails; installed artifact acceptance retains physical queue-drain proof.
parent: pm-u9d0
resolution: "Collect detached telemetry request batches until command_finish under one bounded abortable deadline, cleaning listeners and retaining queue-drain assertions."
expected_result: Valid split-batch delivery passes while missing or stalled completion fails promptly.
actual_result: "Real HTTP positive and negative controls, installed npm/Bun acceptance and 8975-test full suite pass with exact 100/100/100/100 coverage."
